{{- /* Written from Proton Pass the first time a machine applies without this
key, then never touched again: the `create_` prefix makes chezmoi skip the
entry entirely when the target exists, so a local key is never overwritten, no
Proton session is needed on a machine that already has one, and `chezmoi diff`
has nothing to print. Rotating the key means deleting the local file and
applying again. */ -}}
{{ protonPass (printf "%s/private_key" .protonpass.sshKeyItem) | trim }}
